{% extends 'dash/common/_turbo_offcanvas_end.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}No data{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <p>This card has nothing to show for the selected period. The usual reasons:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>The agent hasn't pushed this metric yet — it can take a few minutes after the first run.</li>
        <li>The component doesn't expose it: the feature is disabled on the server, or the version you run doesn't report it.</li>
        <li>The agent runs where it can't read it, typically from another machine or another container than the component itself.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If the other cards of the same page are filled, the agent is running fine and the metric itself is missing.</p>
{% endblock %}
